{"seq":3,"slug":"endocrine-metabolic","title":"大学临床医学 — 内分泌与代谢疾病","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/endocrine-metabolic","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-内分泌与代谢疾病\">大学临床医学 — 内分泌与代谢疾病</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>内分泌系统通过激素实现远距离化学信号调控，与神经系统共同维持机体稳态。内分泌疾病的临床逻辑遵循&quot;激素过多-激素不足-激素抵抗&quot;三大范式：甲状腺功能亢进是甲状腺激素过多，糖尿病是胰岛素不足或抵抗，库欣综合征是皮质醇过多。诊断路径通常为&quot;临床表现→激素水平测定→影像定位→病因明确&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"糖尿病\">糖尿病</h3><p>糖尿病（diabetes mellitus, DM）是以慢性高血糖为特征的代谢综合征，全球患病人数已超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 亿。</p>\n<p><strong>分型与发病机制</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>占比</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>典型发病年龄</th>\n<th>自身抗体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自身免疫破坏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 细胞→胰岛素绝对缺乏</td>\n<td>儿童/青少年</td>\n<td>GAD-Ab、IA-2 阳性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>胰岛素抵抗 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 细胞功能进行性下降</td>\n<td>中老年（趋势年轻化）</td>\n<td>阴性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>妊娠期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>胎盘激素致胰岛素抵抗</td>\n<td>妊娠期</td>\n<td>阴性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊类型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>MODY、胰腺疾病、药物性等</td>\n<td>不定</td>\n<td>不定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>诊断标准（ADA/CDS）：空腹血糖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>7.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 7.0\\,\\text{mmol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，或 OGTT 2 h 血糖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>11.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 11.1\\,\\text{mmol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>6.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HbA1c \\geq 6.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.5%</span></span></span></span></span>，或随机血糖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>11.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 11.1\\,\\text{mmol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span> 伴典型症状（多饮、多尿、多食、消瘦）。</p>\n<p>2 型糖尿病的药物治疗已从&quot;阶梯式降糖&quot;转向&quot;以患者为中心的综合管理&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[确诊 2 型糖尿病] --&gt; B{HbA1c 水平}&#10;    B --&gt;|&lt; 9%| C[二甲双胍 + 生活方式干预]&#10;    B --&gt;|≥ 9%| D[二甲双胍 + 联合用药]&#10;    C --&gt; E{3 个月后 HbA1c 达标?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[维持方案]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G{合并 ASCVD/CKD/心衰?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[加 SGLT2i 或 GLP-1 RA]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[加 DPP-4i/SGLT2i/SU 等]&#10;    D --&gt; J[考虑胰岛素起始]\">graph TD\n    A[确诊 2 型糖尿病] --&gt; B{HbA1c 水平}\n    B --&gt;|&lt; 9%| C[二甲双胍 + 生活方式干预]\n    B --&gt;|≥ 9%| D[二甲双胍 + 联合用药]\n    C --&gt; E{3 个月后 HbA1c 达标?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[维持方案]\n    E --&gt;|否| G{合并 ASCVD/CKD/心衰?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[加 SGLT2i 或 GLP-1 RA]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[加 DPP-4i/SGLT2i/SU 等]\n    D --&gt; J[考虑胰岛素起始]</pre><p>糖尿病慢性并发症分为<strong>微血管</strong>（视网膜病变、肾病、神经病变）和<strong>大血管</strong>（冠心病、脑卒中、外周动脉病）。糖尿病肾病是终末期肾病（ESRD）的首要病因。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HbA1c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 控制目标一般为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7%</span></span></span></span></span>，但老年或低血糖高风险患者可放宽至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"甲状腺疾病\">甲状腺疾病</h3><p><strong>甲状腺功能亢进症</strong>（甲亢）：最常见病因为 Graves 病（弥漫性毒性甲状腺肿），由 TSH 受体抗体（TRAb）持续刺激甲状腺引起。临床表现为代谢增高综合征——心悸、多汗、手抖、消瘦、食欲亢进；特征性体征包括突眼（浸润性眼病）和弥漫性甲状腺肿。</p>\n<p>实验室检查模式：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>↓</mo><mo>↓</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TSH \\downarrow\\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓↓</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FT_3 \\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FT_4 \\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TRAb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 阳性。</p>\n<p>治疗选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抗甲状腺药物（ATD）</td>\n<td>甲巯咪唑（MMI）</td>\n<td>无创、可逆</td>\n<td>疗程长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\text{-}18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 月）、复发率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\text{-}60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放射性碘（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>131</mn></msup><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{131}I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">131</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>治愈率高</td>\n<td>常导致甲减、孕妇禁忌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手术</td>\n<td>甲状腺次全切除</td>\n<td>快速有效</td>\n<td>手术风险（喉返神经损伤、甲状旁腺损伤）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>甲状腺功能减退症</strong>（甲减）：最常见病因为桥本甲状腺炎（慢性自身免疫性甲状腺炎）。临床表现与甲亢相反——畏寒、乏力、水肿、便秘、反应迟钝。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>↑</mo><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TSH \\uparrow\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑↑</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>↓</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FT_4 \\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span></span></span></span></span>。治疗为左甲状腺素（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-T_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）终身替代。</p>\n<h3 id=\"肾上腺疾病\">肾上腺疾病</h3><p><strong>库欣综合征</strong>（皮质醇增多症）：最常见病因为医源性（长期服用外源性糖皮质激素），内源性中以垂体 ACTH 腺瘤（Cushing 病）最多见。典型表现为向心性肥胖、满月脸、水牛背、紫纹、高血压、高血糖。</p>\n<p>诊断三步法：① 筛查（24 h 尿游离皮质醇、午夜唾液皮质醇、小剂量地塞米松抑制试验）；② 定性（血浆 ACTH 水平区分 ACTH 依赖性与非依赖性）；③ 定位（垂体 MRI、肾上腺 CT、岩下窦静脉采血）。</p>\n<p><strong>原发性肾上腺皮质功能不全</strong>（Addison 病）：双侧肾上腺皮质被破坏（自身免疫、结核等）。表现为皮肤黏膜色素沉着、乏力、低血压、低钠高钾。肾上腺危象时需紧急静脉补充氢化可的松和生理盐水。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位 52 岁男性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HbA1c = 8.2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.2%</span></span></span></span></span>，BMI <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>kg/m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 28\\,\\text{kg/m}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，已使用二甲双胍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mg/d</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1500\\,\\text{mg/d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/d</span></span></span></span></span></span> 半年。既往有心肌梗死史。请为其选择下一步联合用药，并解释选择依据。</li>\n<li>一位年轻女性出现心悸、消瘦、双手细震颤，查体发现甲状腺 II° 弥漫性肿大和轻度突眼。如何通过实验室检查确认诊断？如果患者计划 1 年内妊娠，治疗方案应如何调整？</li>\n<li>比较 1 型和 2 型糖尿病在发病机制、自身抗体、C 肽水平和初始治疗方案上的核心区别。</li>\n<li>一位患者长期服用泼尼松治疗类风湿关节炎，近来出现向心性肥胖和满月脸。这是内源性还是外源性库欣综合征？如果需要减停激素，为什么不能骤然停药？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Williams Textbook of Endocrinology</strong>：内分泌学经典教材，糖尿病和甲状腺章节深入而全面。</li>\n<li><strong>ADA Standards of Care in Diabetes（2024）</strong>：每年更新的糖尿病管理标准，免费在线获取（diabetes.org）。</li>\n<li><strong>中国 2 型糖尿病防治指南（2020 版）</strong>：中国特色循证推荐，包含适合中国人群的降糖策略。</li>\n<li><strong>UpToDate</strong>：内分泌各疾病的临床决策支持工具，适合从诊断到治疗的系统性查阅。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>内分泌疾病的诊断思维以&quot;激素轴&quot;为主线：下丘脑-垂体-靶腺形成负反馈环路，一个环节的异常会在血液检查中留下特征性的激素水平模式（如甲亢时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TSH</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 极低而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FT_3/FT_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升高）。糖尿病作为最常见的代谢疾病，其管理已从单纯降糖进化为以心肾获益为导向的综合策略。甲状腺和肾上腺疾病虽然各自表现迥异，但诊断路径一致——从功能评估（激素水平）到病因定位（影像+病理），治疗目标是恢复激素稳态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 内分泌与代谢疾病","id":"大学临床医学-内分泌与代谢疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"糖尿病","id":"糖尿病"},{"level":3,"text":"甲状腺疾病","id":"甲状腺疾病"},{"level":3,"text":"肾上腺疾病","id":"肾上腺疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 呼吸系统疾病","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/respiratory-diseases"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 外科学总论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/surgical-principles"}}